    <bpmn:process id="W_W3850" name="W3850. Basket, Conversion &amp; Attach Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; commercial question
Frequency: Weekly + monthly + quarterly
Volume: ~2.8M monthly transactions
Owner: Sales Enablement / Analytics / Merchandising
Participants: Sales Enablement, Analytics (links to VS-28.1), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Store Ops (links to VS-07), In-Store Services (links to VS-09), Finance (links to VS-17.4/VS-101), Pricing (links to VS-01.2/VS-57)
Source: workflow W3850 — Basket, Conversion &amp; Attach Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3850_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3850_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3850_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3850_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3850_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3850_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3850_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3850_Start3" name="Reporting cycle; commercial question">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3850_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3850_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics analyze basket (size, units, composition, category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Analytics analyze basket (size, units, composition, category mix), conversion (footfall → transaction where measurable), and attach (primary item → accessory/service/link-sell) by store/department/category/region/time, using POS/ecommerce data (links to VS-08/VS-10)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3850_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3850_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3850_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Merchandising identify attach/basket opportunities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Merchandising identify attach/basket opportunities (under-attached categories, missing link-sells, service attach gaps — links to W3846) and translate into playbook/coaching actions (links to W3835/W3836) and promo/pricing actions (links to VS-01.2/VS-14)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Merchandising / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3850_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3850_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3850_Task6" name="Sales Enablement/Finance measure the revenue/margin impact of attach/basket…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Enablement/Finance measure the revenue/margin impact of attach/basket initiatives and report to commercial (links to VS-101/VS-33.2)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3850_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3850_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3850_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3850_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3850_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-603 (ensure controlled execution — Selling Performance, Attachment &amp; Clienteling Analytics (PA-124.3).) | - operational: analytics; operational: playbook/coaching linkage
Owner: Sales Enablement / Analytics / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3850_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3850_Annotation8" targetRef="W3850_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3850_Flow10" sourceRef="W3850_Start3" targetRef="W3850_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3850_Flow11" sourceRef="W3850_Task4" targetRef="W3850_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3850_Flow12" sourceRef="W3850_Task5" targetRef="W3850_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3850_Flow13" sourceRef="W3850_Task6" targetRef="W3850_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
