    <bpmn:process id="W_W3852" name="W3852. Trade-Pro Capture &amp; B2B Selling Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B strategy (links to VS-11/VS-107); reporting cycle
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Trade-pro/B2B capture analytics
Owner: Sales Enablement / Trade Sales / Analytics
Participants: Sales Enablement, Trade Sales (links to VS-11), Key Account (links to VS-107), Trade Pro (links to VS-43), Analytics (links to VS-28.1), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Merchandising (links to VS-01)
Source: workflow W3852 — Trade-Pro Capture &amp; B2B Selling Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3852_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3852_Lane1" name="Sales Enablement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3852_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3852_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3852_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3852_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3852_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3852_Start3" name="B2B strategy (links to VS-11/VS-107); reporting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3852_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3852_Task4" name="Sales Enablement/Analytics measure trade-pro capture: identification of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Enablement/Analytics measure trade-pro capture: identification of trade-pros at POS (links to VS-43), trade-pro share of revenue/basket, project/quotation conversion (links to VS-11.2/VS-66), and B2B/account growth (links to VS-107)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Trade Sales / Analytics
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead / Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3852_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3852_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3852_Task5" name="Sales Enablement/Trade-Sales identify capture gaps (unidentified trade-pros…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Enablement/Trade-Sales identify capture gaps (unidentified trade-pros, low project attach, weak account growth) and translate into trade-pro selling enablement (links to W3837) and program actions (links to VS-43/VS-107)
Responsible (R): Sales Enablement / Trade Sales / Key Account
Accountable (A): Sales Enablement Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3852_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3852_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
